A '''krill farmer'''<ref name="Databank">{{Databank|klatooinian-raiders|Klatooinian raiders}}</ref> was an individual who harvested and captured [[Krill (creature)|krill]]. Krill farmers seeded ponds to attract the creatures, a process that could take generations to fully come to fruition. The farmers scooped the krill into baskets, then drained the water.<ref name="Mandalorian4">{{TheMandalorian|Chapter 4: Sanctuary}}</ref> In [[9 ABY]],<ref>{{MandoDate|4}}</ref> a [[human]] [[Unidentified human tribe|tribe]] on [[Sorgan]] consisted of krill farmers. The krill were used to brew the drink [[spotchka]], which was served at a nearby [[Sorgan Common House|common house]].<ref name="Mandalorian4" />

